Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.17,0:22:23.35,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}狙いさだめた  指先がさす
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.37,0:22:25.72,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}運命は絶望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.74,0:22:28.32,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}それとも希望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.65,0:22:34.77,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}ゆらぎの中で  受信してゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:36.91,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}悲しみにも負けない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:39.60,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}勇気だけをください
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.07,0:22:45.85,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}大切なもの  守るため
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:51.26,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}「強さ」はあると信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:57.12,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Saving our future　一緒に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.39,0:23:00.28,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}明日へのドア開いた空へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.29,0:23:02.74,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}飛び立とう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.89,0:23:08.60,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}とある世界の果てで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.71,0:23:14.36,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}駆け抜けてく　Real Force
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.54,0:23:21.98,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}光を放って!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.17,0:22:23.35,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}那命中注定的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.37,0:22:25.72,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}是絕望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.74,0:22:28.32,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}還是希望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.65,0:22:34.77,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}在搖擺中 發送著信息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:36.91,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}請賜予我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:39.60,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}不會向悲傷低頭的勇氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.07,0:22:45.85,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}為了保護珍貴的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:51.26,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}我相信自己的堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:57.12,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Saving our future  讓我們一同
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.39,0:23:00.28,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}敞開明天的門  向開闊的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.29,0:23:02.74,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}展翅高飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.89,0:23:08.60,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}向那世界的彼端
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.71,0:23:14.36,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}飛馳而去 Real Force
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.54,0:23:21.98,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}散發出光芒!
